0..68 Comment "//! `resumed` gives a cancellation that resumes a task continuation."
69..72 Comment "//!"
73..153 Comment "//! The exit clause resumes the rest of its scope once. The resumed continuation"
154..231 Comment "//! reads the task end exactly once. The resumed continuation closes the task"
232..253 Comment "//! end exactly once."
254..257 Comment "//!"
258..334 Comment "//! The handler starts a task. The task sends its note. The task closes. The"
335..396 Comment "//! exit operation resumes the continuation before a receive."
397..400 Comment "//!"
401..431 Comment "//! - see: #1334 — `resumed`"
432..470 Comment "// The import gives the task protocol."
